    "players": [ { "hand": ["Bottomless Pool // Locker Room"], "battlefield": ["Cult Healer", "Island", "Island", "Island", "Island", "Island", "Island"] }, { "battlefield": ["Grizzly Bears"] } ],
    "steps": [
